---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="About | RetroPortDB">
  <header class="page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Project scope</p>
    <h1>About RetroPortDB</h1>
    <p>A small, evidence-led catalogue for technical projects that preserve or modernize old games.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Included</h2>
    <p>Modern source ports, decompilations, recompilations, reverse-engineered engines, and clean-room reimplementations.</p>
    <h2>Excluded</h2>
    <p>Emulators, ROMs, BIOS files, hosted game assets, download mirrors, launcher software, and installation management.</p>
    <h2>How claims work</h2>
    <p>Curated facts have upstream evidence. Generated GitHub metadata is timestamped observation data and cannot establish maturity or compatibility.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
